# No API key is required or accepted by the web build.
# AI Summarizer and Translate PDF are unavailable in the public web beta, and a
# VITE_* variable would be inlined into the public browser bundle.
# The desktop build stores a user-owned key in the on-disk app store instead
# (settings.json, key: geminiApiKey) and is configured from the app UI.

# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.
APP_URL="http://localhost:3001"
